TI  - CRISPR/Cas9-mediated efficient genome editing via blastospore-based transformation in entomopathogenic fungus Beauveria bassiana
AN  - 28368054
DO  - 10.1038/srep45763
VL  - 8
DA  - 2017/04
PY  - 2017
T2  - Scientific reports
J2  - Sci Rep
